<title>USA: General Host Corp Q1 shr $0.23 vs $0.11.</title>
<headline>General Host Corp Q1 shr $0.23 vs $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Host Corporation</p>
<p>			(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						    Sixteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>						   May 18,	 May 19,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p>Sales					  $ 178,243     $ 172,708</p>
<p>						 =========     =========</p>
<p>Income before income taxes		   5,602	   3,004</p>
<p>Income taxes (a)						     210</p>
<p>						 :::::::::     :::::::::</p>
<p>Net Income				   $   5,602     $   2,794</p>
<p>						 =========     =========</p>
<p>Net earnings per share: (b) (c)</p>
<p>  Primary				    $    0.23     $    0.11</p>
